{"id":93,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","transliteration":"Wal-ḍuḥā","translation":"By the morning brightness"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","transliteration":"Wa-al-layli idhā sajā","translation":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","transliteration":"Mā waddaʿaka rabbuka wamā qalā","translation":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you]."},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَلَلْءَاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Walalākhiratu khayrul-laka mina l-ūlā","translation":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life]."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Walasawfa yuʿ'ṭīka rabbuka fatarḍā","translation":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًۭا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yajid'ka yatīman faāwā","translation":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّۭا فَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka ḍāllan fahadā","translation":"And He found you lost and guided [you],"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًۭا فَأَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka ʿāilan fa-aghnā","translation":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient."},{"number":9,"arabicText":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","transliteration":"Fa-ammā l-yatīma falā taqhar","translation":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him]."},{"number":10,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā s-sāila falā tanhar","translation":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him]."},{"number":11,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā biniʿ'mati rabbika faḥaddith","translation":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it]."}]}